*All forms gain immunities to: [[critical hit]]s, [[sneak attack]]s, [[death magic]], [[poison]], [[disease]], [[level drain]], [[ability drain]], [[mind-affecting]] spells, and [[paralysis]].
*[[Off-hand]] weapon and bracer/gauntlet/glove properties never merge.

==Custom content notes==
*A custom class must have this feat in their feat list, or that class will not be able to select it as a general feat.
